{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"5606ff53dbf6d121dcf5f38beb3bd015c6c14b0f2915d7372d34815a7afdda23","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["對摩押的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「摩押人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回對他們的懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們把以東王的骸骨焚燒成灰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在摩押，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀加略的城堡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摩押要在戰爭的喧囂、吶喊和號角聲中滅亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要剷除摩押的首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺死那裡所有的官長。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對猶大的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「猶大人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回對他們的懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們厭棄耶和華的訓誨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不遵守我的律例。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們祖先祭拜的偶像使他們走入歧途。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要降火在猶大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒毀耶路撒冷的城堡。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對以色列的審判"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「以色列人三番四次地犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不收回對他們的懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們為了銀子賣掉義人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為了一雙鞋賣掉窮人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們踐踏窮人如同踐踏地上的塵土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使卑微的人無處伸冤；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"父子同淫一女，褻瀆我的聖名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在每座祭壇旁邊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們把窮人抵押的衣服鋪開，躺在上面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又在上帝的殿裡喝剝削來的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"「以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在你們面前消滅了亞摩利人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然他們像香柏樹那樣高大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如橡樹那樣強壯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我滅盡了他們上面的果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"砍斷了他們下面的根。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾帶你們出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在曠野引導你們四十年，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們得到亞摩利人的土地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從你們的子孫中興起先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從你們的青年中興起拿細耳人","poem":1},{"noteId":2},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人啊，難道不是這樣嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，你們迫使拿細耳人喝酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"禁止先知說預言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我要壓碎你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如滿載穀物的車軋過一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"快捷的無法逃遁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"強壯的無力可使，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇猛的救不了自己，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拉弓的站立不住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"腿快的無法逃脫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"騎馬的不能自救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，最勇猛的戰士也要赤身逃命。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"拿細耳人的詳情參見民數記6·1‑8。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}